# API routes

## Conventions

- Validate every input with Zod schemas imported from `@receiptbrain/contracts` (same schemas the client uses)
- Call `await requireSession()` at the top of every handler except `/api/health`
- Enforce ownership on every Prisma query (`where: { userId: session.user.id }`)
- Use cursor-based pagination on list endpoints
- Apply rate limit middleware to `/api/upload` (30/hr/user) and `/api/recommend` (10/hr/user)
- Stream receipt images only via signed URLs from `/api/receipts/:id/image` — never expose S3 URLs

## Required routes (outline)

```
POST   /api/upload                       # multipart → S3 → enqueue extract_receipt
GET    /api/receipts                     # cursor pagination + filters
GET    /api/receipts/:id
PATCH  /api/receipts/:id                 # user correction
DELETE /api/receipts/:id                 # soft delete
GET    /api/receipts/:id/image           # signed-URL stream
GET    /api/receipts/:id/status          # polling for extraction progress
GET    /api/subscriptions
PATCH  /api/subscriptions/:id            # cancel/pause/confirm
GET    /api/insights                     # ?type=&status=
PATCH  /api/insights/:id                 # seen/dismissed/actioned
POST   /api/recommend                    # enqueue generate_insights
GET    /api/health                       # public; db + redis + ai
```

## Upload contract

- MIME allowlist: `image/jpeg`, `image/png`, `image/heic`, `application/pdf`
- Max size: `MAX_UPLOAD_MB` env (default 10)
- Compute sha256 → dedup against `Receipt.imageHash` for this user (return existing receipt if hit)
- Response: `{ receiptId, status, jobId }`

## Testing

Integration tests mock S3, Redis/BullMQ, and Prisma. Required cases per route:

- Unauthed → 401
- Cross-user access → 403
- Invalid input → 400 with `{ error, details }`
- Happy path → expected status + body + side effects (enqueue called, row created)
- Rate limit hit → 429 (for limited routes)

```typescript
it('returns 400 when no file', async () => { ... });
it('dedupes when imageHash already exists', async () => { ... });
it('enqueues extract_receipt with receiptId as idempotencyKey', async () => { ... });
it('rejects request from another user', async () => { ... });
```
